<title>CHILE: Chile's Soquimich H1 net earnings slips.</title>
<headline>Chile's Soquimich H1 net earnings slips.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fertilizer producer Sociedad Quimica y Minera de Chile SA (Soquimich) on Wednesday reported the following consolidated results in the first half of the year:</p>
<p>			  H1 1997	   H1 1996</p>
<p>Net earnings		   34.3		34.6</p>
<p>Operating profit	     37.4		36.6</p>
<p>Non-operating profit	  1.7		 3.8</p>
<p>Total sales		   250.9	     215.4</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in millions of dollars.</p>
<p>((--Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
